OpenShazam third-party software notices
=======================================

This file contains license notices for Rust dependencies included in the
OpenShazam Windows x64 product build. The build also appends the applicable
native Windows redistributable notices and license files from the pinned
SettingsHost NuGet packages.

Rust dependency notices below are generated from Cargo metadata and crate
license files using cargo-about 0.9.1.

